NOTICE

This folder is a fork of the official 2Captcha browser extension
https://github.com/rucaptcha/2captcha-solver (MIT license, (c) 2022 2captcha),
upstream version 3.3.3. The original LICENSE is kept next to this file.

Changes made by the ImNotARobot project:

- every API call goes to the local ImNotARobot server (http://127.0.0.1:8765 by
  default) instead of 2captcha.com / rucaptcha.com; the address is a setting;
- the 2captcha soft id (referral number 2834), links to 2captcha.com, the
  account sign-up hints and the contact block were removed;
- the page-facing message channel was tightened: getConfig now answers with the
  detection switches only (never the access key, the server address or the proxy),
  and a page-initiated solve must pass the same enabled/auto-solve switches as the
  on-page button, must name a widget the extension itself found, is solved with that
  widget's own params and is rate-limited per tab in the background;
- the app is found by probing 127.0.0.1:8765-8774 for /app-info (which this fork adds
  to the app's server); the access key is only ever sent to a server that answers
  with {"app": "imnotarobot"};
- host_permissions were narrowed from <all_urls> to localhost, so the extension
  can only talk to the local solver; content scripts still run on all pages,
  which is what detection needs;
- the "account" panel now shows the balance of the ImNotARobot solver (the
  balance of its human-workers step) and its currency;
- the extension name, description and the solver-button text were rebranded,
  and the broken key field of the options page was fixed.

Everything else (captcha detection, page processing, the options UI) is
upstream code.
